./idmap
./types
/core/arena
/core/table
/lang/ast/decl
/lang/ast/module

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ CachedSignature is Struct

+ names U32
+ types U32
+ params U32
+ args U32
+ errors U32
+ returns TypeId

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SignatureCache

` Signatures already evaluated from syntax, each under one receiver and one set of bound type
` parameters, so that ranking a declaration at another call site reads it back. A row's names
` are its parameters; its types are their variables, then its arguments, then its errors.

+ rows Table'CachedSignature
+ names List'Atom'ArenaBacking
+ types List'TypeId'ArenaBacking
_ arena Arena
_ keys IdMap
_ key-scratch Array'U32'ArenaBacking
_ key-count Size

────────────────────
+ This
    - arena Arena

.. rows = Table'CachedSignature(arena, 64)
.. names = List'Atom(arena)
.. types = List'TypeId(arena)
.. key-scratch = Array'U32(arena, 16)

────────────────────
+ do release

keys.release()

────────────────────
+ do open-key
    - module ModuleId
    - decl DeclId
    - receiver TypeId
    - class-params Bool
    - bindings Size

. count = 4 + bindings * 2
if count > key-scratch.length
    . capacity = key-scratch.length
    while capacity < count
        capacity *= 2
    key-scratch = key-scratch.resize(capacity, arena)
key-scratch[0] = module
key-scratch[1] = decl
key-scratch[2] = receiver
key-scratch[3] = if class-params then 1u32 else 0u32
key-count = 4

────────────────────
+ do add-binding
    - name U32
    - type TypeId

key-scratch[key-count] = name
key-scratch[key-count + 1] = type
key-count += 2

────────────────────
+ get found Index?

keys.find(key-scratch.data, key-count)

────────────────────
+ do keep
    - row CachedSignature

keys.store(key-scratch.data, key-count)
if keys.last-inserted
    rows.append(row)
